1
00:00:00,067 --> 00:00:05,387
There are eight layers between the President of the United States and anyone who wants to hurt him.

2
00:00:05,633 --> 00:00:09,025
The outermost layer is sixty nautical miles wide.

3
00:00:09,065 --> 00:00:10,775
The last one is a person.

4
00:00:11,233 --> 00:00:11,991
Layer one.

5
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:12,628
The sky.

6
00:00:12,867 --> 00:00:16,863
Wherever the president goes, the airspace around him closes.

7
00:00:16,903 --> 00:00:21,437
A restricted ring, usually thirty nautical miles in every direction.

8
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:27,406
Inside that sits a second ring, about ten miles out, where almost every flight is banned.

9
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:29,402
The FAA writes the rules.

10
00:00:29,442 --> 00:00:32,729
The military enforces them, with fighter jets.

11
00:00:32,967 --> 00:00:42,258
After the 2025 inauguration, NORAD responded to more than forty planes that wandered into the rings around Mar-a-Lago alone.

12
00:00:42,733 --> 00:00:43,467
Layer two.

13
00:00:43,507 --> 00:00:44,396
The advance.

14
00:00:44,633 --> 00:00:50,212
Before the president arrives anywhere, a Secret Service advance team gets there first.

15
00:00:50,252 --> 00:00:53,805
For a campaign event, usually three to five days ahead.

16
00:00:53,845 --> 00:00:56,287
For a foreign trip, it can be a month.

17
00:00:56,533 --> 00:00:58,662
They walk every place he might go.

18
00:00:58,702 --> 00:01:01,404
The hotel, the route, the nearest hospital.

19
00:01:01,444 --> 00:01:02,616
Even the bathrooms.

20
00:01:02,867 --> 00:01:07,589
Then the lead agent writes the security plan that every other layer follows.

21
00:01:08,067 --> 00:01:08,905
Layer three.

22
00:01:08,945 --> 00:01:09,857
The rooftops.

23
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:18,397
Outside, a counter sniper team watches from high ground, with long range optics, looking for anyone who should not be there.

24
00:01:18,633 --> 00:01:23,021
And this layer shows what happens when one fails.

25
00:01:23,061 --> 00:01:32,328
On July 13, 2024, in Butler, Pennsylvania, a gunman climbed onto a roof about 147 yards from the stage.

26
00:01:32,567 --> 00:01:34,476
That roof had not been secured.

27
00:01:34,516 --> 00:01:39,066
Eight shots were fired before a Secret Service counter sniper killed him.

28
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:46,042
The agency's own review later found failures in its advance planning and in communication with local police.

29
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:47,196
Layer four.

30
00:01:47,236 --> 00:01:48,199
The checkpoint.

31
00:01:48,433 --> 00:01:55,330
Everyone who gets close walks through a magnetometer, run by the Secret Service Uniformed Division.

32
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:57,291
Staff, guests and reporters.

33
00:01:57,331 --> 00:01:58,272
No exceptions.

34
00:01:58,733 --> 00:01:59,422
Layer five.

35
00:01:59,462 --> 00:02:00,350
The motorcade.

36
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:09,989
When he moves, local police close the roads, and the president travels inside a convoy that carries its own counter assault team and an ambulance.

37
00:02:10,233 --> 00:02:12,460
The counter assault team has one job.

38
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:17,053
If the motorcade is attacked, they fight, so everyone else can get him out.

39
00:02:17,533 --> 00:02:18,245
Layer six.

40
00:02:18,285 --> 00:02:18,996
The Beast.

41
00:02:19,233 --> 00:02:21,003
The president's limousine.

42
00:02:21,043 --> 00:02:30,889
Its real specifications are classified, but reports describe doors about eight inches thick, built from steel, aluminum, titanium and ceramic.

43
00:02:31,133 --> 00:02:33,672
Estimates put its weight at around eight tons.

44
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:42,116
And according to multiple reports, the trunk carries a supply of the president's own blood type, in case he cannot reach a hospital.

45
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,391
Layer seven.

46
00:02:43,431 --> 00:02:44,084
The shift.

47
00:02:44,333 --> 00:02:51,467
The agents closest to the president work in rotating shifts, and they talk about him on the radio using a code name.

48
00:02:51,700 --> 00:02:54,434
The Secret Service does not pick those names.

49
00:02:54,474 --> 00:02:58,625
They come from a list kept by the White House Communications Agency.

50
00:02:58,867 --> 00:03:00,873
Barack Obama was Renegade.

51
00:03:00,913 --> 00:03:02,605
Donald Trump is Mogul.

52
00:03:02,645 --> 00:03:04,258
Joe Biden was Celtic.

53
00:03:04,733 --> 00:03:05,507
Layer eight.

54
00:03:05,547 --> 00:03:06,524
The last layer.

55
00:03:06,767 --> 00:03:10,818
When every other layer has failed, what is left is an agent's body.

56
00:03:11,067 --> 00:03:18,296
On March 30, 1981, outside the Washington Hilton, shots were fired at Ronald Reagan.

57
00:03:18,533 --> 00:03:23,964
Agent Tim McCarthy turned toward the gunfire and spread his body in front of the president.

58
00:03:24,004 --> 00:03:25,467
He was shot in the chest.

59
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:26,405
He survived.

60
00:03:26,445 --> 00:03:29,636
And he was not even supposed to be working that day.

61
00:03:29,676 --> 00:03:32,618
He was on the shift because he lost a coin flip.

62
00:03:32,867 --> 00:03:35,252
So that is presidential protection.

63
00:03:35,292 --> 00:03:43,360
Sixty nautical miles of closed sky, eight layers of people and steel, and at the very center, sometimes, a coin flip.

64
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,553
Which layer surprised you the most?

65
00:03:45,593 --> 00:03:46,919
Tell me in the comments.
